@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 4.1.2 – Generate Operation Plans)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "<<container (C4)>>\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nPort Logistics (Backend)" as PORT #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nScheduling & Planning" as SCHED #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nOEM (Backend)" as OEM #87CEEB
participant "<<external>>\nIAM" as IAM #F5F5DC

-> UI: 1: request to generate Operation Plans
activate UI
UI -> IAM: 1.1: validate token
activate IAM
IAM --> UI: 1.1.1: token valid
deactivate IAM
UI --> : 1.2: prompt for date and algorithm selection
deactivate UI

-> UI: 2: select date and scheduling algorithm
activate UI
UI -> PORT: 2.1: GET /api/vesselvisitnotifications (approved, for date)
activate PORT
PORT --> UI: 2.1.1: list of approved VVNs
deactivate PORT

UI -> SCHED: 2.2: POST /api/scheduling/daily (VVNs, algorithm)
activate SCHED
SCHED --> UI: 2.2.1: generated Operation Plans (preview)
deactivate SCHED

UI --> : 2.3: display Operation Plans preview
deactivate UI

-> UI: 3: confirm to save Operation Plans
activate UI
UI -> OEM: 3.1: POST /api/operationplans/batch (plans with metadata)
activate OEM
OEM --> UI: 3.1.1: plans saved confirmation
deactivate OEM
UI --> : 3.2: display success message
deactivate UI

@enduml
